## Recent Fixes Applied

### 1. PyArrow C-Extension WDAC Shim ([`pyarrow_compat.py`](file:///c:/Users/himan/Downloads/sf_rs_accelerator-20260902T162545Z-1-001/sf_rs_accelerator/pyarrow_compat.py))
