- **Fix**: Implemented `pyarrow_compat.py` to stub blocked modules in `sys.modules` before `pandas` initializes. Imported at the top of [`app_final.py`](file:///c:/Users/himan/Downloads/sf_rs_accelerator-20260902T162545Z-1-001/sf_rs_accelerator/app_final.py) and [`chunk_02_job_queue_engine.py`](file:///c:/Users/himan/Downloads/sf_rs_accelerator-20260902T162545Z-1-001/sf_rs_accelerator/chunk_02_job_queue_engine.py).

